        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bobby Tench, Marilyn Manson, Brian Hugh Warner, Max Middleton, Beck\n- Products: Rough and Ready, Born Villain\n- Companies: Cooking Vinyl, Hell, etc.\n- Roles: vocalist, guitarist, sideman, songwriter, arranger, singer, musician, composer, actor, painter, author, music journalist, keyboardist\n\nFacts:\n- Brian Hugh Warner was born on January 5, 1969.\n- Robert Tench, also known as Bobby Tench, is a British vocalist, guitarist, sideman, songwriter, and arranger.\n- Brian Hugh Warner, known professionally as Marilyn Manson, is an American singer, songwriter, musician, composer, actor, painter, author, and former music journalist.\n- Beck enlisted Bobby Tench as vocalist for the album Rough and Ready.\n- Rough and Ready is the first recording on which keyboardist Max Middleton is heard.\n- Born Villain was released on April 25, 2012 by Cooking Vinyl and Marilyn Manson's Hell, etc. label.",
